OL,3,AUS aircraft carrier docks near Thai
OL,4,Abeach resort Pattaya after record 250
OL,5,Adays at sea
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter a record 250 days at sea without
OL,8,Fa port stop, the nuclear-powered
OL,9,Faircraft carrier USS Abraham Lincoln
OL,10,Fhas docked in Thailand, giving its
OL,11,Fnearly 5,000 crew members a much-needed
OL,12,Fbreak.
OL,14,FThe ship is docking close to the beach
OL,15,Fresort of Pattaya, known for its
OL,16,Fraucous nightlife and for sex tourism.
OL,17,FFor the US it also carries strong
OL,18,Fhistorical echoes.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
