OL,3,AUS aircraft carrier docks near Thai
OL,4,Abeach resort Pattaya after record 250
OL,5,Adays at sea
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen the weary sailors walk into the
OL,8,Fcity's bars and restaurants, they will
OL,9,Fliterally be treading in the footsteps
OL,10,Fof the hundreds of thousands of US
OL,11,Ftroops who came here for R&R ` rest and
OL,12,Frelaxation - during the Vietnam War.
OL,14,FThey transformed it from a sleepy
OL,15,Ffishing village to one of the world's
OL,16,Fmost famous and frenetic party towns.
